  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder with resnet50 image encoder and transformer aggregation achieves high performance (config_014). This experiment tests whether replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l image encoder (while keeping RNA encoder, aggregation, and fusion consistent) improves accuracy, isolating the impact of the image encoder choice. This clarifies whether the current best image encoder (resnet50) is optimal or if a more advanced model (imagenet_vit_l) could further enhance performance."
